{"id":"1cdf7925a164f89d","group":"90","path":"90/90-lem-sequence-coding.md","title":"Primitive Recursive Sequence Coding","display":"lem-sequence-coding — Primitive Recursive Sequence Coding","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-lem-sequence-coding","aliases":["90-lem-sequence-coding"],"display":"lem-sequence-coding — Primitive Recursive Sequence Coding","depends_on":["[[90-df-sequence-encoding]]","[[90-df-sequence]]","[[90-df-prefix-projection]]","[[90-df-sequence-concatenation]]","[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[90-df-divrem-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-lem-sequence-coding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-lem-sequence-coding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-sequence-coding — Primitive Recursive Sequence Coding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5dc32170bd55a322\" href=\"?note=5dc32170bd55a322\" title=\"90-df-sequence-encoding\">90-df-sequence-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4293e1643a9254d8\" href=\"?note=4293e1643a9254d8\" title=\"90-df-sequence\">90-df-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"80418eede5544150\" href=\"?note=80418eede5544150\" title=\"90-df-prefix-projection\">90-df-prefix-projection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a24d8667957b1216\" href=\"?note=a24d8667957b1216\" title=\"90-df-sequence-concatenation\">90-df-sequence-concatenation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f0ea0e26dd8bcf09\" href=\"?note=f0ea0e26dd8bcf09\" title=\"90-df-divrem-function\">90-df-divrem-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,i,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(s,i,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(s)_i\">\\(\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(s)_i\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4293e1643a9254d8\" href=\"?note=4293e1643a9254d8\" title=\"90-df-sequence\">90-df-sequence</a>，其具体编码见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5dc32170bd55a322\" href=\"?note=5dc32170bd55a322\" title=\"90-df-sequence-encoding\">90-df-sequence-encoding</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{\\le i}(s)\">\\(\\pi_{\\le i}(s)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\frown m\">\\(s\\frown m\\)</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Seq}(s)\">\\(\\operatorname{Seq}(s)\\)</span> 上取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"80418eede5544150\" href=\"?note=80418eede5544150\" title=\"90-df-prefix-projection\">90-df-prefix-projection</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a24d8667957b1216\" href=\"?note=a24d8667957b1216\" title=\"90-df-sequence-concatenation\">90-df-sequence-concatenation</a> 的原接口。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Entry},\\operatorname{Pfx},\\operatorname{App}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{Entry},\\operatorname{Pfx},\\operatorname{App}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是下式定义的全辅助函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}_k,\\mathrm{PRPred}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}_k,\\mathrm{PRPred}_k\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Entry}(s,i)&amp;\\coloneqq(s)_i,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pfx}(s,i)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\pi_{\\le i}(s),&amp;\\operatorname{Seq}(s),\\\\1,&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{Seq}(s),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{App}(s,m)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}s\\frown m,&amp;\\operatorname{Seq}(s),\\\\2^{m+1},&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{Seq}(s),\\end{cases}\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{Seq}\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_1\\land\\operatorname{Len}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1\n\\land\\operatorname{Entry}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2\\land\\operatorname{Pfx}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2\n\\land\\operatorname{App}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Entry}(s,i)&amp;\\coloneqq(s)_i,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pfx}(s,i)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\pi_{\\le i}(s),&amp;\\operatorname{Seq}(s),\\\\1,&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{Seq}(s),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{App}(s,m)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}s\\frown m,&amp;\\operatorname{Seq}(s),\\\\2^{m+1},&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{Seq}(s),\\end{cases}\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{Seq}\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_1\\land\\operatorname{Len}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1\n\\land\\operatorname{Entry}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2\\land\\operatorname{Pfx}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2\n\\land\\operatorname{App}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>截断减法、商余及整除的有界搜索均由末参数原始递归实现。素数判定有界于被测数；已知第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个素数后，下一素数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_n!+1\">\\(p_n!+1\\)</span>，故素数枚举可由原始递归给出。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s&gt;0\">\\(s&gt;0\\)</span>，合法序列长度至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>。对每个候选长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\le s\">\\(n\\le s\\)</span>，检查前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个素数的正指数，并检查 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 等于这些素数幂的积；指数由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\le s\">\\(a\\le s\\)</span> 的有界搜索求得。不存在合法长度时返回零。坐标使用有界指数并检查合法性。前缀与追加均由有限乘积重编码；所有循环上界和循环体都是原始递归函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=0\">\\(s=0\\)</span>、空列及越界坐标按定义的分支处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>三个全辅助函数的图现已在 Assertion 中定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pfx},\\operatorname{App}\">\\(\\operatorname{Pfx},\\operatorname{App}\\)</span> 不改变原前缀和追加运算的合法输入域。结论针对本书的具体素数幂编码，不是关于任意有效编码的原始递归性断言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-sequence-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"5dc32170bd55a322","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sequence-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"4293e1643a9254d8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-prefix-projection","status":"resolved","id":"80418eede5544150","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-prefix-projection]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence-concatenation","status":"resolved","id":"a24d8667957b1216","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sequence-concatenation]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"abc082683aa1de80","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-divrem-function","status":"resolved","id":"f0ea0e26dd8bcf09","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-divrem-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"4293e1643a9254d8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s,i,m\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(s)_i$ 见 [[90-df-sequence]]，其具体编码见 [[90-df-sequence-encoding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"5dc32170bd55a322","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s,i,m\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(s)_i$ 见 [[90-df-sequence]]，其具体编码见 [[90-df-sequence-encoding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-prefix-projection","status":"resolved","id":"80418eede5544150","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\pi_{\\le i}(s)$ 与 $s\\frown m$ 只在 $\\operatorname{Seq}(s)$ 上取 [[90-df-prefix-projection]]、[[90-df-sequence-concatenation]] 的原接口。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence-concatenation","status":"resolved","id":"a24d8667957b1216","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\pi_{\\le i}(s)$ 与 $s\\frown m$ 只在 $\\operatorname{Seq}(s)$ 上取 [[90-df-prefix-projection]]、[[90-df-sequence-concatenation]] 的原接口。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"abc082683aa1de80","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Entry},\\operatorname{Pfx},\\operatorname{App}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ 是下式定义的全辅助函数；$\\mathrm{PR}_k,\\mathrm{PRPred}_k$ 见 [[90-df-primitive-recursive]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s,i,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(s)_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_{\\le i}(s)","display":false},{"tex":"s\\frown m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Seq}(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Entry},\\operatorname{Pfx},\\operatorname{App}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}_k,\\mathrm{PRPred}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Entry}(s,i)&\\coloneqq(s)_i,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pfx}(s,i)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\pi_{\\le i}(s),&\\operatorname{Seq}(s),\\\\1,&\\neg\\operatorname{Seq}(s),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{App}(s,m)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}s\\frown m,&\\operatorname{Seq}(s),\\\\2^{m+1},&\\neg\\operatorname{Seq}(s),\\end{cases}\\\\\n&\\operatorname{Seq}\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_1\\land\\operatorname{Len}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1\n\\land\\operatorname{Entry}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2\\land\\operatorname{Pfx}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2\n\\land\\operatorname{App}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"p_n!+1","display":false},{"tex":"s>0","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"n\\le s","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"a\\le s","display":false},{"tex":"s=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pfx},\\operatorname{App}","display":false}],"bytes":2492,"backlinks":[{"id":"01ab533da9c8c517","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$e,z,y,a,b,h,i,j,n\\in\\mathbb N$；数值序列的 $\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(s)_i$ 取 [[90-df-sequence]]，$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}$ 取 [[90-df-sequence-encoding]]；原始递归性见 [[90-lem-sequence-coding]]。"},{"id":"8c071ce52fa72de0","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{LocalLine}_T$ 与 $\\vdash$ 取 [[90-df-predicate-logic]]；$\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(p)_i$ 及 $\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}$ 取 [[90-df-sequence]]、[[90-df-sequence-encoding]]，原始递归性见 [[90-lem-sequence-coding]]。"},{"id":"b53b63652237d07a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"序列码、长度和坐标的原始递归性由 [[90-lem-sequence-coding]] 给出；$\\mathrm{LineOK}_T$ 必须是 [[90-df-proof-predicate]] 对同一证明码格式定义的关系。"},{"id":"42029390ebbb59c5","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"可接受编号谓词 $\\operatorname{AcceptNum}$ 取 [[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]，以本书 $\\Phi$ 及 [[90-df-recursive-function]] 的计算函数类实例化；序列计算性质见 [[90-lem-sequence-coding]]。"},{"id":"a606838813c14669","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$；$T_k$ 见 [[90-df-t-predicate]]，程序与配置编码见 [[90-df-machine-coding]]，序列算法见 [[90-lem-sequence-coding]]。"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-lem-sequence-coding]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-117","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-lem-kleene-normal.md]]\n[[90-lem-lob.md]]\n[[90-lem-norm-fixed-point.md]]\n[[90-lem-parameterized-recursion.md]]\n[[90-lem-program-numbering.md]]\n[[90-lem-q-finite-comparison.md]]\n[[90-lem-sequence-coding.md]]\n[[90-lem-substitution.md]]\n[[90-lem-t-predicate.md]]"}],"outgoing":["5dc32170bd55a322","4293e1643a9254d8","80418eede5544150","a24d8667957b1216","abc082683aa1de80","f0ea0e26dd8bcf09"]}